<view class="screen">
  <view class="eyebrow">YOUR OWN PACE</view><view class="title">我的</view>
  <view class="panel">
    <view class="account-row">
      <view class="account-icon">轻</view>
      <view class="account-main"><view class="heading">{{profile ? '已登录' : '欢迎使用轻体计划'}}</view><view class="muted">{{profile ? '管理你的记录与提醒' : '免登录也能记录饮食和打卡'}}</view></view>
      <button wx:if="{{profile}}" class="small-button" disabled="{{backupBusy || busy}}" bindtap="logout">退出</button>
    </view>
    <block wx:if="{{!profile}}">
      <view wx:if="{{!ready}}" class="notice">账号服务暂未开放，可继续免登录使用。</view>
      <checkbox-group bindchange="onConsent"><label class="consent"><checkbox value="account" checked="{{agreed}}" color="#268b5e" /><text>同意使用微信身份标识登录，不获取手机号、昵称或头像。</text></label></checkbox-group>
      <button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{!ready || !agreed || busy}}" bindtap="login">微信登录</button>
    </block>
    <view wx:if="{{message}}" class="muted space">{{message}}</view>
  </view>
  <view class="panel">
    <view class="topline"><view class="heading">云备份</view><view class="badge">手动备份</view></view>
    <block wx:if="{{profile}}">
      <view class="backup-status"><view class="status-label">{{backupMeta ? '最近备份' : '备份状态'}}</view><view class="status-value">{{backupMeta ? backupMeta.label : '暂无备份时间'}}</view><view wx:if="{{backupMeta}}" class="muted">北京时间 · 新增记录后记得再次备份</view></view>
      <view class="muted">默认记录只保存在本机；只有主动点击备份时，饮食、体重、打卡、常用餐和健康设置才会上传并更新当前账号的云端副本。</view>
      <button class="primary space" loading="{{backupBusy}}" disabled="{{backupBusy}}" bindtap="backupNow">备份本机记录到云端</button>
      <button class="secondary space" disabled="{{backupBusy || !backupMeta}}" bindtap="restoreFromCloud">从云端恢复到本机</button>
      <button wx:if="{{backupMeta}}" class="danger-button space" disabled="{{backupBusy}}" bindtap="deleteCloudBackup">删除云端备份</button>
      <view wx:if="{{backupMessage}}" class="muted space">{{backupMessage}}</view>
    </block>
    <view wx:else class="muted space">登录后可备份饮食、体重与打卡记录，换设备时手动恢复。</view>
  </view>
  <view class="panel">
    <view class="topline"><view class="heading">打卡提醒</view><view class="badge">每次订阅提醒一次</view></view>
    <view wx:if="{{reminderJob}}" class="preview"><view class="strong">{{reminderJob.label}}</view><view>{{reminderJob.date}} {{reminderJob.time}}（北京时间）</view></view>
    <view class="muted space">未打卡才提醒，不会永久每日推送。</view>
    <view class="label">希望收到提醒的时间</view>
    <picker mode="time" value="{{reminderTime}}" bindchange="onReminderTime"><view class="select">{{reminderTime}}（北京时间） ▾</view></picker>
    <view wx:if="{{!reminderReady}}" class="notice">微信推送尚未开通，目前只保存时间偏好。</view>
    <button class="primary space" disabled="{{!reminderReady || reminderBusy}}" loading="{{reminderBusy}}" bindtap="subscribeReminder">订阅下一次未打卡提醒</button>
    <button wx:if="{{reminderReady}}" class="secondary space" disabled="{{reminderBusy}}" bindtap="cancelReminder">取消待发送提醒</button>
    <view wx:if="{{reminderMessage}}" class="muted space">{{reminderMessage}}</view>
    <button class="disclosure" bindtap="toggleReminderInfo">提醒说明<text>{{reminderInfoOpen ? '收起 −' : '展开 ＋'}}</text></button>
    <view wx:if="{{reminderInfoOpen}}" class="muted details">每次主动订阅安排一次；若今天已过提醒时间或已同步打卡，则安排明天。修改时间后需重新订阅。微信弹窗同意后，将提醒时间和当天打卡状态同步到云端，此操作不上传饮食明细或体重。离线打卡未同步时仍可能收到消息。系统约每分钟检查一次，送达可能延迟。</view>
  </view>
  <view class="panel info-panel">
    <button class="disclosure" bindtap="toggleAccountInfo">账号与记录说明<text>{{accountInfoOpen ? '收起 −' : '展开 ＋'}}</text></button>
    <view wx:if="{{accountInfoOpen}}" class="details">
      <view wx:if="{{profile}}" class="muted account-id">账号编号：{{profile.accountId}}</view>
      <view class="muted">登录用于验证微信身份，不要求手机号、昵称或头像。账号编号不是数据访问凭证。</view>
      <view class="muted space">手动备份包括饮食、体重、打卡、历史自定义食物、常用餐及健康设置。恢复会替换本机记录，操作前会再次确认；你也可以单独删除云端备份。</view>
      <view class="muted space">退出登录仍保留本机记录，共用设备上的其他使用者也可能看到这些记录。</view>
    </view>
  </view>
  <button class="secondary" bindtap="goToday">回到今日，记录一餐</button>
</view>
